@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title Deterministic CPG export for external ML systems

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFC
skinparam component {
  BorderColor #495057
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F1F3F5
  BorderColor #495057
}

component "immutable CodePropertyGraph\n45 node kinds + 47 edge relations\nsource ranges + typed overlays" as CPG #DBE4FF
component "node-id min-heap\nascending stable NodeId\ndense identity map" as IDS #C3FAE8
component "typed edge scan\n9-layer in/out degrees\nparallel tuple retention" as EDGES #C5F6FA
component "AST breadth-first machine\ndepth + known bit\nloop nesting" as AST #E5DBFF
component "canonical topology\nforward + reverse PageRank\nexplicit convergence" as PR #FFF3BF
component "optional complete\nbackward PDG slice\ncap after completion" as SLICE #FFE8CC
component "aligned row assembler\n69 named columns\nids + ranges + edges" as ROWS #FFD8A8
component "PygExport\nordinary Rust vectors\noptional serde" as OUT #D3F9D8
component "external adapter\nPyG / tensor runtime / table" as ADAPTER #FCC2D7
component "downstream model\ntraining + evaluation\noutside libcpg" as MODEL #FFE3E3

CPG --> IDS : stable identity
CPG --> EDGES : every typed edge
CPG --> AST : AstChild only
CPG --> PR : all endpoints + unweighted
CPG --> SLICE : PDG edges + optional criterion
IDS --> EDGES : dense endpoints
IDS --> AST : aligned nodes
IDS --> PR : canonical nodes
IDS --> ROWS : node_ids + ranges
EDGES --> ROWS : typed tuples + degrees
AST --> ROWS : structural columns
PR --> ROWS : two centralities
SLICE --> ROWS : exact membership
ROWS --> OUT
OUT --> ADAPTER : caller converts shape
ADAPTER --> MODEL

note bottom of SLICE
  Over budget returns an error.
  No truncated slice becomes a negative label.
end note

note bottom of OUT
  Feature-free and read-only.
  No parser, random seed, learned weight,
  Python runtime, or device tensor.
end note

legend bottom
|= Colour |= Meaning |
|<#DBE4FF>| immutable typed input |
|<#C3FAE8>| canonical stable identity |
|<#C5F6FA>| typed edge evidence |
|<#E5DBFF>| heap-backed AST structure |
|<#FFF3BF>| bounded numerical topology |
|<#FFE8CC>| complete dependence localization |
|<#FFD8A8>| aligned schema assembly |
|<#D3F9D8>| deterministic libcpg output |
|<#FCC2D7>| caller-owned conversion boundary |
|<#FFE3E3>| learning outside libcpg |
endlegend
@enduml
